e.png", "id": "1419758470134789", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593808163_1419758473468122_5463809189124617856_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZFo7HbiFrHIQ7kNvwEp62ga&_nc_oc=AdogSJq7U6FXZH1qI3hjhkZpcXORWqcujsuj9KsrOKuNJuv8lafBoCpTqfq-qIEc9UQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSOZ11JmDZZJYn91ZE86E9BCDchxsIkAHI0mGK0vk0U6g&oe=6B09C533"}, "display_name": "Revisit: Time Travel with Google Earth", "keywords": ["GoogleEarth", "travel", "timetravel", "wander", "StreetView"], "long_description": "**Every place has a past. Revisit lets you step back into it.**\n\nExplore real places in 8K 360\u00b0. Jump between years, compare past and present, and revisit places you remember.\n\n# \u23f3 Travel Through Time\n\nVisit real places across different years.\n\nUse the **Time Rift** to reveal the past right beside the present.\n\n{4125580237715811}\n\n# \u2708\ufe0f See the World in 3D\n\nTake off and fly over cities, mountains, coastlines, and famous landmarks in 3D.\n\n**Fly in 3D** is available as an optional add-on.\n\n{2590542894725256}\n\n# \ud83d\udeb6 Go Anywhere\n\nSearch for a place, step into the street, and start exploring.\n\nMove through neighborhoods, revisit familiar places, or discover somewhere new.\n\n{1818894922581575}\n\n# \ud83c\udf0d Always Something to Explore\n\nJump into featured destinations, changing landmarks, World Cup stadiums, and places behind major stories.\n\n{1496770768298592}\n\n# \ud83d\udcfb Feel More Connected\n\nListen to **Local Radio** and check local headlines while you explore.\n\n{1305243991537071}\n\n**The world changes. Revisit lets you go back and see it for yourself.**\n\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/X5pZxBdcgn\n\nEmail: support@revisitvr.com\n", "short_description": "Revisit the places you remember. Compare then and now, and walk the streets with Google Street View."}]}, "developer_name": "Revisit", "developer_privacy_policy_url"